> [P][ads][ allow][ you][ to][ transition][ nicely][ from][ floor][ to][ pole][.][ Slide][ on][ the][ floor][,][ dragging][ your][ knees][ without][ sticking][ to][ the][ floor][.][ They][ cover][ just][ enough][ of][ your][ knee][ to][ protect][ it][ without][ preventing][ you][ from][ gripping][ the][ pole][.]

