> [The][ design][ of][ the][ wine][ room][ was][ created][ utilizing][ a][ reclaimed][ door][ and][ wood][ from][ a][ barn][ located][ on][ the][ property][.][ We][ were][ able][ to][ use][ the][ reclaimed][ door]['s][ existing][ hardware][ to][ provide][ rust][ic][ charm][ and][ appeal][.][ In][ addition][ the][ wood][ was][ used][ to][ create][ the][ "][X]["][ pattern][ shel][ving][ with][ accent][ lighting][ to][ provide][ warm][ ambient][ light][ that][ enhances][ the][ overall][ look][.]

