=== Text #18 ===
> [Art][ik][P][ix][ is][ an][ app][ designed][ to][ help][ children][ improve][ their][ speech][ production][ at][ the][ word][ and][ sentence][ levels][.][ This][ app][ is][ convenient][ for][ artic][ulation][ practice][ and][ takes][ very][ little][ time][ on][ the][ part][ of][ the][ clin][ician][ to][ set][ up][.][ This][ app][ also][ gives][ you][ the][ option][ of][ taking][ your][ own][ photos][ or][ importing][ pictures][ to][ create][ your][ own][ flash][cards][ to][ use][.][ There][ is][ a][ data][ collection][ feature][ and][ a][ recording][ option][.][ Some][ down][falls][ of][ this][ app][ include][ the][ inability][ to][ remove][ unwanted][ words][ or][ pictures][ and][ you][ can][ only][ work][ on][ one][ target][ at][ a][ time][.]

